1
00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:04,380
Splash, splash, little duck!

2
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:06,680
Quack, quack, quack! Who’s coming through?

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,120
It’s little Ducky, yellow and blue!

4
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:11,440
Put on your boots, the rain is here!

5
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,700
Splash, splash, fun is drawing near!

6
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:20,700
Pitter-patter, raindrops fall…

7
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,920
Little Ducky hears them call!

8
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:25,120
Waddle left and waddle right!

9
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:27,440
Puddles shining, what a sight!

10
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:29,760
Tip-tap, tip-tap, tiny feet!

11
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:32,100
Rainy days are super sweet!

12
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:34,320
Take one step and take one more!

13
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:36,240
Splash into a puddle on the floor!

14
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:38,860
Splash, splash, little duck!

15
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:41,500
Waddle, waddle, what good luck!

16
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:43,620
Quack, quack, quack, and flap your wings!

17
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:45,900
Rainy days are happy things!

18
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:48,260
Splash, splash, one, two, three!

19
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:50,580
Come and splash along with me!

20
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:52,880
Jump up high, then touch the ground!

21
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:55,240
Splashy puddles all around!

22
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:02,160
Froggy comes with boots so red…

23
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:04,280
Bouncing puddles up ahead!

24
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:06,900
Kitty wiggles, “Meow, meow, meow!”

25
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:08,980
Come and join the puddle crowd!

26
00:01:08,980 --> 00:01:11,400
Butterfly flies through the rain…

27
00:01:11,980 --> 00:01:13,560
Rainbow colors shine again!

28
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:16,000
Big splash here and little splash there!

29
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,960
Water droplets everywhere!

30
00:01:17,960 --> 00:01:20,520
Splash, splash, little duck!

31
00:01:20,520 --> 00:01:23,100
Waddle, waddle, what good luck!

32
00:01:23,100 --> 00:01:25,160
Quack, quack, quack, and flap your wings!

33
00:01:25,160 --> 00:01:27,440
Rainy days are happy things!

34
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:29,880
Splash, splash, one, two, three!

35
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:32,120
Come and splash along with me!

36
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:34,360
Jump up high, then touch the ground!

37
00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:36,780
Splashy puddles all around!

38
00:01:36,780 --> 00:01:39,300
Wiggle, wiggle, flap, flap, flap!

39
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:41,480
Stomp your feet and clap, clap, clap!

40
00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:43,720
One big splash — and freeze right there!

41
00:01:43,720 --> 00:01:46,120
Look! A rainbow in the air!

42
00:01:46,260 --> 00:01:48,350
Rain is gone, the sky is blue…

43
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:50,720
Little Ducky waves to you!

44
00:01:50,720 --> 00:01:53,100
Quack, quack, quack, our day was fun!

45
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:55,980
Splashy splash for everyone!
